            <ArticleTitle>Orgone (Reichian) therapy in tension headache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>103-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Orgone (Reichian) therapy, which utilizes a unique physical approach in addition to standard character-analysis, is illustrated in cases of muscle contraction (tension) headache. It offers a more direct technique for attacking the muscular tension (somatic armor) while undermining the psychic defenses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
